## Required outcome
- Once a release has begun production mutation, later runs with an older release version must fail even if that newer run exits before app deployment.
- Retrying a partially failed newer release must not be queued behind and preceded by an older tagged release.

## Suggested approach
- Record the accepted release version durably before migration and compare against that marker, or derive the high-water mark from prior mutating workflow attempts rather than only the active Worker.
